Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:23.67,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}I was sucked into your dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:26.34,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}ショゲ腐っていらんない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:28.47,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}ベタなシチュエーション
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:30.84,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}Hand in glove we fight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:33.06,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}Chemistry is right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:35.72,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}傾げた顔を上げて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:41.15,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}The viper in the shadows striking them all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:44.77,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}点を逸らす暇もない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:46.47,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}But you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.47,0:00:48.16,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}Stop the feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:50.41,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}Take a beating
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.03,0:00:52.95,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}躊躇えば
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.31,0:00:55.58,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}ダラケも焦りも Get back
